            "line": 777,
            "text": "theorem physicalPressure_jet_bound (d : TailData) {K : ℝ} (hK : 1 ≤ K)\n    (n : ℕ) {eta : ℝ} (hη : eta ∈ Icc (-1 : ℝ) 1) :\n    |iteratedDerivWithin n (physicalPressure d K) (Icc (-1 : ℝ) 1) eta| ≤\n      etaConstant d true (-1) n / K"
